{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736692284057190430","content":"\"Planar triangulation would be sporadic leaping from dimension to dimension every 6 seconds does it not seem like a safe place to travel. Currently we only have threats to attack us in the material realm. We do not need to fight beings that can pass through the ship and hunt us in our sleep.\"","created_at":"2020-07-26T05:52:49.851000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-26T05:53:30.628000Z","id":"736823323555790918","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736692284057190430","content":"“You don’t need to *go* to those realms, just locate them. Tether a probe, should be easy enough. Now, the real question: *sandbags*?!”","created_at":"2020-07-26T05:54:05.748000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736823641890881599","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
